      ],
      "title": "黑夜降临·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22610001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红兔子",
          "text": "谢、谢谢……差点以为被杀掉了……你……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红兔子",
          "text": "……嗝！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610004",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "红兔子",
          "text": "好、好可怕的武器……好、好重的血腥气……\n呜呜呜，我不会……要……死翘翘吧……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610005",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "轰嗡嗡嗡，呜鲁——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "嘿，头儿~委托顺利完成——\n看，活蹦乱跳，这是西区的货！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "咕，咕咕……嗝儿！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "呼，还好有惊无险，北面的尾巴足足追了我两条街呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610009",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "红兔子",
          "text": "什么「头儿」、「货」、「尾巴」……\n这些满嘴黑话的家伙，不会是什么……贩卖手办部件的……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "嘿，兔子，放轻松~看你们拼命被人追杀的样子……该不是犯了什么大事吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红兔子",
          "text": "没、没有，没有的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "是吗，看起来你们费尽心机要引开什么人呢~\n难道说……背后有什么大阴谋？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红兔子",
          "text": "受、受人之托，忠、忠人之事……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "noticeKind": "video",
          "sourceId": "22610014",
          "sourceType": 11,
          "text": "此处为游戏视频演出，尚未转写为文字。",
          "type": "notice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "哈哈是吗，看不出来你还挺有骨气~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "红兔子",
          "text": "干、干什么！……我……我是不会屈打成招的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "这么心虚，我看你是不打自招~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "noticeKind": "video",
          "sourceId": "22610018",
          "sourceType": 11,
          "text": "此处为游戏视频演出，尚未转写为文字。",
          "type": "notice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "刚刚「那一幕」是什么……「大猫」……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "noticeKind": "video",
          "sourceId": "22610020",
          "sourceType": 11,
          "text": "此处为游戏视频演出，尚未转写为文字。",
          "type": "notice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "是刚才路过的小巷……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "头儿？奇怪……又休眠了吗，头儿？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "noticeKind": "video",
          "sourceId": "22610023",
          "sourceType": 11,
          "text": "此处为游戏视频演出，尚未转写为文字。",
          "type": "notice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "「她」有危险！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22610026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "什么「她」？\n——头儿，你去哪儿？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-485",
